+## Sites
+
+A request names its site in the `X-Larder-Site` header (a site id such as
+`annex`); without the header the site is `main`. A site that does not exist
+is a 400 `unknown_site`, on every route.
+
+Batches, stock on hand (`onHand` and `batches` under `/items`), cooking,
